data: {"id": "7596b29f03334cbd-thinking-parallel_evidence-1339", "run_id": "7596b29f03334cbd", "node": "parallel_evidence", "node_name": "parallel_evidence", "thinking_type": "ai_message", "tool_name": null, "content": "## 已采集事实\n\n### 1. Kubernetes 状态（kubectl describe）\n- Pod 当前处于 **Running** 但容器处于 **CrashLoopBackOff**，符合预期。\n- **Exit Code 78**（非 137，非 OOMKilled），Last State Reason = **Error**。\n- 重启次数：**20 次**，与 Prometheus 指标 `kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=20` 一致。\n- **Environment: <none>** — 容器未定义任何环境变量，其中包含 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG`。\n- Command 确认行为：`python3 -u -c import os, sys; value = os.getenv('APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG'); ... sys.exit(78 if value is None else 0)` — 当 `APP_REQUIRED_CONFIG` 缺失时主动 `exit(78)`。\n- ", "status": null, "result_preview": null, "duration_seconds": null, "iteration": 2, "ts_ms": 1789144901672, "lane_stage": "evidence"}

